{
  "bookId": "hero-212204",
  "id": "bond-27524",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27524001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "啧，不要紧张。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "今天，我保证不会动你的……任何一个小玩意儿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "如果拆掉她们会让你伤心的话，我保证，一根汗毛都不会碰——阿抱歉我忘了，她们没有汗毛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27524005",
              "text": "那还真是……谢谢。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27524004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "今天是个特别的日子，对你，对我，对她们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27524007",
              "text": "今天？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27524007",
              "text": "……是什么特别的节日吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27524006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "是时候让那些不自量力的小东西知道，你和我的关系了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "——我亲爱的，「所有物」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27524010",
              "text": "虽然但是……是不是有什么搞反了？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27524010",
              "text": "明明你才是我买来的手办。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27524009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "嘘——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "看来你还什么都不知道，真是年轻的猎物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27524013",
              "text": "这是什么意思？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27524012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "你该不会以为，在恰巧的时间、恰巧的地点、恰巧得到心仪的手办……只是巧合而已吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27524014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "为了来到这里，我可花费了不少心力。\n——用你们所谓的，「大数据」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "27524",
